# ── PRIVATE WORKING MEMORY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC. The AIBrain protocol instructs the agent to write
# facts into these files on every significant event, so they accumulate real
# project, client and decision detail. They must never be committed.
#
# Only the *.template.md seeds are tracked. scripts/install.sh copies a template
# into place on first run, so a fresh clone still validates.
memory/active-task.md
memory/corrections.md
memory/journal.md
memory/scratchpad.md
memory/learnings-inbox.md
brain/decisions/_index.md

# Credentials never belong in the brain at all — use the private vault.
.env
*.key
*.pem
.wp-auth
secrets/

# Feeds are generated (refresh.sh creates them)
feeds/*.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
